NAME: Checkers

DESCRIPTION:

American Checkers (English
draughts). Play as Red against
the CPU (Black).

Controls (tap below the board):
- You First: new game, you first
- CPU First: new game, CPU first
- Diff: cycle Easy/Medium/Hard

Rules: mandatory captures,
multi-jumps, men move/capture
forward only, kings either
direction (non-flying). Crowning
ends the turn.

CPU uses minimax with
alpha-beta pruning. Difficulty
sets search depth (2 / 3 / 4).
